## Installation

Downloaded Sysmon from the Microsoft Sysinternals website.

Extracted the archive.

Opened an elevated Command Prompt.

Installed Sysmon using:

```cmd
Sysmon64.exe -accepteula -i sysmonconfig.xml
```

---

## Configuration

The lab uses the SwiftOnSecurity Sysmon configuration.

The configuration filters unnecessary events while enabling high-value telemetry commonly used by SOC analysts.

Examples include:

- Process Creation
- Network Connections
- Driver Loading
- Registry Changes
- File Creation
- DNS Queries

